WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
Little girl, I brought my son to apologize to you.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,840
Chen Li is just stupid

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,720
He is actually a nice person and knowledgeable

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,560
They are much more reliable than those outside.

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,720
If you obey him

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,920
Our family will definitely treat you well in the future

7
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,160
Don't think I don't know what you really think

8
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,120
Don't, don't misunderstand

9
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,560
Auntie is also doing it for your own good

10
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,720
How can people outside have the foundation of our building?

11
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,760
My son is always loyal

12
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,820
I warned you not to come again

13
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,780
I'm not easy to mess with

14
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,900
Why do you have to test again and again?

15
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,460
My mother forced me to

16
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,300
She said you must have a lot of food at home

17
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,420
Just get you done

18
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,260
From now on, our family will not have to worry about food and drink.

19
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,490
I told you, please let me go

20
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:41,930
Turns out he’s not a fellow countryman

21
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,490
I’m thinking about my family’s supplies

22
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:44,890
Mo Shi is not ruthless

23
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:47,420
I really can't suppress these people's bad intentions

24
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:54,440
I have to completely destroy their face

25
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,360
Town building can only be managed temporarily

26
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,640
But at least I should be able to live in peace for the next few days.
